CHANGES MADE HERE
-----------------
* run-se.py: `UnConstrainedCPU` -> `UnconstrainedCPU` (typo fix, from PIE).
* run_se_probe.py, run_se_forkloop.py: added by this project. They measure the
  first-stdin-read tick and run the fork-amortized loop over test inputs, and
  read the sysroot path from $PIE_GEM5_ROOTFS. See ../README.md.
* Upstream files not used by this experiment have been removed.
